-- CHECKLIST R1.3 — the Pre-Advertising Checklist as the team writes it
-- (ver. r1.3-26) (2026-10-15)
-- ===========================================================================
-- WHY (the user, 2026-10-15, with three checklists the team wrote by hand:
-- "this is the pre-advertising report that i expected when draft with AI")
--
-- WHAT CHANGED
--   * `checklist_template('pre_ads')` is ver. r1.3-26. Campaign Details
--     gains Primary Destination and Monthly Budget; Country and Ad
--     Re-Targeting are written answers (a split by share, a plan by month);
--     Tracking & Analytics is Pixel / Analytics Connection, Lead
